{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼前还能承担什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"那股力气没能让他放下对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"生活的牵挂\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又想怪自己不够坚定，可安宁和争取这两样，他都真舍不得，再咬牙也难免伤到一边。\",\n      \"key\": \"都真舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他想到争取可能耗掉温柔，心里还是疼，也盼着少伤一点的办法，可眼前该争取的事不能一直搁着。\",\n      \"key\": \"不能一直搁着\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里还没安稳，就先接下眼前该担的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下眼前该担\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后，他仍没底，却开始重新考虑眼前能承担什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并调整跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来力气却不能消除牵挂的限度。删去 S02-2 到 S11-2 的弱因果箭头，改由 S06-7 说明他为何仍放不下那种真实安慰过自己、却尚未实现的生活。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [],\n      \"what\": \"删除重复项\",\n      \"why\": \"只靠怀念不能保护珍惜之物，已由 S07-2 和 S10-3 交代。本段不再重复总结，S11-5 保留眼前之事不能一直搁置的实际压力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把旧日自责、安宁和争取两样都舍不得、再咬牙也难免伤到一边合成一个具体念头，保留他对自己不够坚定的怀疑如何被改写，避免重复总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想到争取会耗掉温柔时的心疼、想少伤一点的愿望，以及眼前该争取的事不能一直搁置的压力，避免把等待无用写成格言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并删去重复前半\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4 和 S11-5 已交代不舍、恐惧与争取的代价。本条只保留他心里尚未安稳便先接下责任的实际行动，并由 S07-2 说明为何不能继续等待。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8dbd457a-c299-4d6b-9a06-a225970bead6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T145459836282Z", "elapsed_seconds": 747.484, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:07:27.321560+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7ed191fa0a98968d193eef85ea4ac0700f39cea7954ef64cdd33e759f05de0d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b94